cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Benthic Video Toolbox"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
abstract: "This is a standalone GUI application for pre and post processing of benthic video annotations with biigle. It has been developed as part of the FUTURE-OBS research project which aims to find innovative observation methods for coastal socio-ecosystem and is based on videos taken with the towed benthic sled Pagure developped by Ifremer. However it can be used and extended for other acquisition systems."
authors:
    - family-names: LIBERGE
      given-names: Anouk
    - family-names: ROMERO RAMIREZ
      given-names: Alicia
      orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9167-3686
keywords:
    - oceanography
    - biodiversity
    - imaging
license: GNU GPL V3.0 or later
